    "content": "void main() {\n    Material mat = Material(vec3(1.0), 0.5);\n    vec3 color = shade(mat, vec3(0.0, 1.0, 0.0));\n    float falloff = SQUARE(1.0 / float(MAX_LIGHTS)) * PI;\n    gl_FragColor = vec4(color * falloff, 1.0);\n}",
